    "site_desc": "The tower is located in a 16 acre/2.25 MW DC solar PV array constructed in 2024. The primary vegetaion at the site is a pollinator friendly grass mix. Study plots of other vegetation including different grass mixes and currants are located within the tower footprint, though they make up a small portion of the footprint area. Prior to construction of the solar array, the field was planted with annual crops. The site is located on a south-facing slope at the bottom of which is a stream. Crop feilds are located to the north, east and west of the array.",
